        <body>\r\n                <p>Hey there Everyone !<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We just got back and I have a full review of the resort along with pictures and the wedding process and lots of helpful tricks for your trip and planning<\/p>\n<p>I couldn't get the paste from word function to work so I attached the review entitled Blog below<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Bring on any questions you may have and I included templates for OOT bag stuff here too !<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope this helps everyone and it was amazing so hope your special day is just as great !<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>xoxo<\/p>\n<p>Jess<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jnvoigt@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"66.56.187.156","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423638007,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282082.jpg?_r=1428850100","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jnvoigt","Id":282082,"Name":"jnvoigt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.65.74.207","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79050,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"34ef3a57f4d1507344ad388422df157f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;This is so helpful - thank you very much for sharing!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892832,"PostDate":1428834332,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>This is so helpful - thank you very much for sharing!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashley225@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.117.140","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426920585,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282492.jpg?_r=1429067506","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"AshleyNYC323","Id":282492,"Name":"AshleyNYC323","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"156.57.21.15","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79050,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ff1355ddfec918113d5a0fd5cc0e69d3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I can&#039;t view any of your attachments, is there anyway you can you email me directly - VERY interested!!! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;danamarielouise@hotmail.com&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;THANKS!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892843,"PostDate":1428843958,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I can't view any of your attachments, is there anyway you can you email me directly - VERY interested!!! \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>danamarielouise@hotmail.com<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>THANKS!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"danamarielouise@hotmail.co