{"Success":true,"Data":{"OtherParticipants":[],"Messages":[{"Id":17166,"Author":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1429007649,"Content":"Hi Marinah! My postal code is V3X2K3 Surrey, BC Canada","PostKey":"f89a9307033017b56e80bcd2f6121f06","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":17167,"Author":{"Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1429008810,"Content":"<p>Hi Wafflesmom!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It's quoting me $38.65 - not sure if it'd be worth it for you to order it new then? \u00a0Not sure how much it is off of Amazon to Canada :S<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you want it, let me know <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!<\/p>\n<p>Marina<\/p>\n","PostKey":"5e023c2f1a1bf84896c6c3d396641472","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":17168,"Author":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1429009166,"Content":"Thanks so much Marinah! I thought it would be pricey. I'm going to do some online research to see how much it is here and let you know. Just to confirm, it's the 66' trifold right?","PostKey":"a1e1af4fb7732e9caa2b893288756661","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":17169,"Author":{"Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWid