{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":80196,"Title":"liked a post you made in New Bdw Mobile App For Both...","Message":"Hello!\n\nSteveW just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nJust downloaded.  looks good so far\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79055-new-bdw-mobile-app-for-both-ios-and-android\/?view=findpost&p=1892883\n","Sender":{"Id":206829,"Name":"SteveW","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206829.jpg?_r=1386354305","PhotoWidth":344,"PhotoHeight":339,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429056276,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80161,"Title":"liked a post you made in How To Say \"no Kids...","Message":"Hello!\n\njaspbri0317 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nOuch. That's getting into a very sticky situation. We had the same deal but it was because it's our grandchildren and my husband didn't want me carrying a baby around the entire night instead of enjoying our reception.\n \nHaving said that, it's very difficult to include some an...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79060-how-to-say-no-kids-to-some-and-not-to-others\/?view=findpost&p=1893040\n","Sender":{"Id":236302,"Name":"jaspbri0317","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236302.jpg?_r=1429022808","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1429048959,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79971,"Title":"liked a post you made in How To Say \"no Kids...","Message":"Hello!\n\nmarinah84 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nOuch. That's getting into a very sticky situation. We had the same deal but it was because it's our grandchildren and my husband didn't want me carrying a baby around the entire night instead of enjoying our reception.\n \nHaving said that, it's very difficult to include some an...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79060-how-to-say-no-kids-to-some-and-not-to-others\/?view=findpost&p=1893040\n","Sender":{"Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429012256,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79939,"Title":"liked a post you made in How To Say \"no Kids...","Message":"Hello!\n\nhellosassypants just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nOuch. That's getting into a very sticky situation. We had the same deal but it was because it's our grandchildren and my husband didn't want me carrying a baby around the entire night instead of enjoying our reception.\n \nHaving said that, it's very difficult to include some an...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79060-how-to-say-no-kids-to-some-and-not-to-others\/?view=findpost&p=1893040\n","Sender":{"Id":280004,"Name":"hellosassypants","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280004.jpg?_r=1412891058","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429010380,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79929,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that jaspbri0317 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79061-eloping-with-guests-std-wording\/?view=findpost&p=1893051\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\" I guess you are right! I don't know why I feel like I have to explain myself! lol \n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":236302,"Name":"jaspbri0317","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236302.jpg?_r=1429022808","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1429009481,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79928,"Title":"liked a post you made in Eloping With Guests: Std Wo...","Message":"Hello!\n\njaspbri0317 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nIs there a reason why you even have to explain? The STD is generally just the first \"hey we're getting married on this date in this place, hope you can make it, details to follow\". Would it be that much of a shock to everyone that you feel you would need to explain the decision? As you me...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79061-eloping-with-guests-std-wording\/?view=findpost&p=1893043\n","Sender":{"Id":236302,"Name":"jaspbri0317","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236302.jpg?_r=1429022808","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1429009472,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79667,"Title":"liked a post you made in David's Bridal Bridesma...","Message":"Hello!\n\nLaurenC3432 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI got my wedding dress from Davids in 2011, and the girl that was supposed to be my MOH got her dress at the same time. They told me 3 to 4 months for both. We ordered March 19th (I still have the bill!) and if I remember correctly both dresses were in by the end of May. I had no problems with...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79048-davids-bridal-bridesmaid-dresses-question\/?view=findpost&p=1892810\n","Sender":{"Id":281421,"Name":"LaurenC3432","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428943422,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79644,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that marinah84 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/?view=findpost&p=1892944\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\"\n \nHmmm - here's a different link, does it work?  I got it straight from the album under \"Get Link\" for this one!\n \nhttps:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.784031153664.1073741863.54300091&type=1&l=a8a5688cd7 (https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.784031153664.1073741863.54300091&type=1&l=a8a5688cd7)\n \n \n \n@\"Wafflesmom\"\n \nIt was a BLAST!  So much fun!  We both swam in college, so I think it was a little easier.  Towards the end, though, I was definitely getting tired.  I fell asleep in the car on the way back to the resort, haha.  I loved that I didn't have to worry about mascara with the eyelash extensions, too!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428939140,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79544,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"acw271011,\n\ncalgarybride2015 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"First aid kits\".\n\ncalgarybride2015 said:\n======================================================================\nI agree on the travel meds, we did those and a couple bandaids and that's it for that type of thing. People used them and thanked us. When you start getting into alcohol swabs and gauze and the like, they seems a lot less likely to get used. If something major happens it won't be enough and there is first aid at the resorts. Just my 2 cents. \n\nOctober isn't that far away really but I totally understand the hesitation.  Good luck in September.\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9343&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428915521,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9343},{"Id":79512,"Title":"liked a post you made in New Bdw Mobile App For Both...","Message":"Hello!\n\nAlexBrecher just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nJust downloaded.  looks good so far\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79055-new-bdw-mobile-app-for-both-ios-and-android\/?view=findpost&p=1892883\n","Sender":{"Id":282720,"Name":"AlexBrecher","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282720.jpg?_r=1429089603","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428883900,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79508,"Title":"liked a post you made in Our Dw: Dreams Riviera Canc...","Message":"Hello!\n\nhellosassypants just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nYou ladies have just reaffirmed for me why I love being here. I'm sitting here with tears in my eyes because 3 of you are getting married very soon and it makes my heart happy!\n \n@  - that article you posted is so perfect! And most of the time so absolutely right! It's what br...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77696-our-dw-dreams-riviera-cancun-17-apr-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1892816\n","Sender":{"Id":280004,"Name":"hellosassypants","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280004.jpg?_r=1412891058","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428883803,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79493,"Title":"liked a post you made in Kcole123 Planning Thread -...","Message":"Hello!\n\ntygrrlily just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nKristy, have an amazing wedding week and enjoy every moment!\n-----------------------------\n\n \nHey girl. Hope all is well with you! Nice to see you pop in!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78626-kcole123-planning-thread-april-17-2015-melia-caribe-tropical\/?view=findpost&p=1892871\n","Sender":{"Id":277296,"Name":"tygrrlily","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277296.jpg?_r=1421643766","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428878853,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79468,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"acw271011,\n\ncalgarybride2015 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"First aid kits\".\n\ncalgarybride2015 said:\n======================================================================\nNo I didn't get them as I only did stuff that fit in the cups. They are def first aid kits - had things like gauze, alcohol swabs, q-tips, bandaids, etc. Possibly a bit more than you want! But I've def seen them there. In the meds and bathroom goods area.\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9343&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428874706,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9343},{"Id":79455,"Title":"started a new personal conversation with you","Message":"acw271011,\n\ncalgarybride2015 has sent you a new personal conversation entitled \"First aid kits\".\n\ncalgarybride2015 said:\n======================================================================\nI've seen similar kits at dollarama <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=showConversation&topicID=9343#msg17106\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428869431,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9343},{"Id":79453,"Title":"liked a post you made in 3 For 1 Kimonos At La Vie E...","Message":"Hello!\n\nWafflesmom just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"eriddell\" data-cid=\"1892822\" data-time=\"1428845574\">For those canadian brides... not sure if they have this store in the states. They have 3 for 1 kimonos at la vie en Rose Boutique... so I got 3 kimonos for my bridesmaids for $40! They have...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79049-3-for-1-kimonos-at-la-vie-en-rose-boutique\/?view=findpost&p=1892857\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428869120,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79391,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that vancouverpetunia mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79043-calling-for-rain-on-your-wedding-day\/?view=findpost&p=1892836\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\" - Thank you, but we were just there on vacation! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/> Getting married in a year. But we were able to visit our resort for an afternoon, so it was a great opportunity to see it in person. \n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428848238,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79379,"Title":"liked a post you made in Our Dw: Dreams Riviera Canc...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nYou ladies have just reaffirmed for me why I love being here. I'm sitting here with tears in my eyes because 3 of you are getting married very soon and it makes my heart happy!\n \n@  - that article you posted is so perfect! And most of the time so absolutely right! It's what br..