t article you posted is so perfect! And most of the time so absolutely right! It's what br...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77696-our-dw-dreams-riviera-cancun-17-apr-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1892816\n","Sender":{"Id":277264,"Name":"kcole123","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277264.jpg?_r=1421648383","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428800153,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79329,"Title":"liked a post you made in Acw271011 So This Is Not A...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThanks on the dress! I do think it's pretty and is a good compromise on the one that I originally wanted. Now to see what the pricing is!\n \nYou're absolutely right about the printer. I did test printing and while I thought I had a good one, which I do, for printing the tags th...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/?view=findpost&p=1892589\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428797109,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79238,"Title":"liked a post you made in Calling For Rain On Your We...","Message":"Hello!\n\ndreamweddings just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThanks @dreamweddings  That's wonderful advice Joyce! What a wonderful way to celebrate! By dancing in the rain!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79043-calling-for-rain-on-your-wedding-day\/?view=findpost&p=1892741\n","Sender":{"Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428755617,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79217,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that moonpalacebride2be mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/71-show-us-your-wedding-dress\/?view=findpost&p=1892772\n\n----------------------------------\nThanks @\"acw271011\" <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>  I am SO happy that I am not the only one who doesn't know info on my dress LOL- I had no idea it is not uncommon!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":282426,"Name":"moonpalacebride2be","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282426.jpg?_r=1429093370","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428752347,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79179,"Title":"liked a post you made in New Venue Opening Soon, Hya...","Message":"Hello!\n\ncalgarybride2015 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nWow! It's a beautiful resort! The rooms are just a tiny bit ultra modern for my taste but the colours are gorgeous! Couldn't find anything about AI though, but even so, using points for a flight is doable.\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79046-new-venue-opening-soon-hyatt-playa-del-carmen\/?view=findpost&p=1892727\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428717655,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79149,"Title":"liked a post you made in Perianjay Planning Thread -...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"TinkerSofi\" data-cid=\"1892730\" data-time=\"1428722831\">I had the same question lol. I totally want to know what's inside! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/>\n \nWe printed our invites at Staples, we asked for a sample first and the color was still off from wh...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/?view=findpost&p=1892734\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428713463,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79117,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that ashhtayy mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/?view=findpost&p=1892732\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"TinkerSofi\" @\"acw271011\" a cute book we can write our wedding vows in so that when we're crying and can't remember everything we had planned to say we can take a quick peak at a cute book rather than cue cards or lined paper <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n\nI plan on having my vows down pat so these will likely just be used for a picture or two lol\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":282006,"Name":"ashhtayy","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282006.png?_r=1423373502","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":138,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428709370,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79080,"Title":"liked a post you made in New Venue Opening Soon, Hya...","Message":"Hello!\n\ncalgarybride2015 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nWell I remember when Royalton opened in RM and they were advertising it about 6 months ahead. Sunwing has the exclusive to it like Transat does to Azul Fives but it's just so odd that nobody has it. I tried itravel2000 since they carry everybody's packages, plus sell off vacations and nothing...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79046-new-venue-opening-soon-hyatt-playa-del-carmen\/?view=findpost&p=1892715\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428702034,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":78968,"Title":"liked a post you made in Veryvalero's Wedding Pl...","Message":"Hello!\n\nMrsCtoB just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nI didn't change my name when Doug and I got married. After coming out of a long very nasty marriage, I went back to my maiden name. I had been under someone else's thumb for so long it was like I needed to get back to point A. I spent 16 weeks in a program for women in abusive situations and r...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/?view=findpost&p=1889671\n","Sender":{"Id":266526,"Name":"MrsCtoB","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266526.jpg?_r=1427840086","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428674604,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":78946,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that perianjay mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/?view=findpost&p=1892670\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\" Thanks! Check out the seller on Etsy! Her shop name is \"Sandelles\" handmade italian leather sandals made in Cyprus <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> They are nice and light too and very comfortable.. The front strap isn't tight.\n \nI'm not 100% about adding more lines onto the tag, but I'm sure the seller could work something out.. she has a ton of different tags.\n \nYou can order the robes in a smaller quantity, they are just $10 instead of $8 if you do less than 5 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428672119,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"387","TotalPages":13,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":360},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
