{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":80204,"Title":"sent you a friend request","Message":"Wafflesmom,\n\nvancouverpetunia wants to be your friend!\n\nThis message has been sent because vancouverpetunia has added you to their friends\nlist. As you've chosen to approve all friend requests, you will need to visit your\nfriends list and approve them.\n\nLog in and then manage your friends: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&section=friends&module=profile&do=list&tab=pending\n","Sender":{"Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429048454,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Profile","RelatedItemId":281283},{"Id":80057,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"Wafflesmom,\n\nmarinah84 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Wally bag\".\n\nmarinah84 said:\n======================================================================\nAbsolutely!  Let me know <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>  no one else has expressed interest yet, but if they do, i'll check back with you first!\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9375&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429009321,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9375},{"Id":80047,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"Wafflesmom,\n\nmarinah84 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Wally bag\".\n\nmarinah84 said:\n======================================================================\nHi Wafflesmom!\n \nIt's quoting me $38.65 - not sure if it'd be worth it for you to order it new then?  Not sure how much it is off of Amazon to Canada :S\n \nIf you want it, let me know <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>  \n \nThanks!\nMarina\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9375&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429008810,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9375},{"Id":80043,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that perianjay mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/?view=findpost&p=1893090\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"Wafflesmom\" I bought both at the same time and used both coupons. It depends on how nice the person is at checkout lol, but usually I have Chester with me when we goto Walmart.. so worst case I would've just given him one to buy. They can't deny the person with you.\n \nYes! go with the Pepto.. they are actually perfect. They come in a box and they have 48 per box. It's not the small box that the pills\/capsules are in - it's a bigger box & they are the full sized chewables\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429008481,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80039,"Title":"liked a post you made in Snswedding2016 Planning Thr...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThanks @ ! So the coupon works on top of the sale price? Were you able to use two coupons two but two boxes at the same time? Or did you have to pay for each separately?And thank you guys for the pepto tip! I was going to buy rolls of tums but it's not the sameI agree @ , this forum is awesom...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/?view=findpost&p=1893088\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429008372,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80028,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that veryvalentine mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/?view=findpost&p=1893086\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"Wafflesmom\" @\"perianjay\"\n \nThanks sooo much for sharing this!  How amazing is this forum?  I can't even imagine planning this wedding without this forum.  I would be left with no friends if I only had them to go back and forth with these things.  lol  Nobody really cares as much as we do!!  I'm so excited to use my coupon!  Thank you ladies! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1429007732,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80022,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that perianjay mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/?view=findpost&p=1893084\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"Wafflesmom\" @snswedding2015 @\"veryvalentine\"\n \nI bought Emergen-C from Walmart and used my coupon. I believe Emergen-C was only $10 at Walmart when I bought it - I used the $5 coupon and I bought two boxes. I also purchased my Pepto from there as well.. They came in plastic individual wrap (48 pack). I just had to cut them into twos.\nI paid $20 for a total of 96 chewables and I plan to give two per person or four per couple.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429007532,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80015,"Title":"liked a post you made in Sparklers! (Reception,...","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  I've been wanting to do this as well but not sure how feasible it is to get sparklers so thanks for starting the thread!@  thanks for the tip on asking your photographer, I'll see if he can get some for me.Do you guys think you can light them by having lit candles (bigger ones) say maybe a...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79058-sparklers-reception-first-dance\/?view=findpost&p=1893071\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429007060,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80014,"Title":"quoted a post you made","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that one of your posts has been quoted by marinah84.\n\nThe post that was quoted can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79062-wallybags-66-inch-tri-fold-destination-bag-90\/?view=findpost&p=1893081\n\nThe post that marinah84 submitted can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79062-wallybags-66-inch-tri-fold-destination-bag-90\/?view=findpost&p=1893082\n\n----------------------------------\n------------ QUOTE ----------\n@\"marinah84\" I'd be interested but not sure how much shipping would be to Canada\n-----------------------------\n\n \n \nMessage me your zip code\/postal code, and I'll look it up!  It weighs about 4.5lbs shipped, though the box is a little awkward.  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of quoted posts, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429006849,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80003,"Title":"quoted a post you made","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that one of your posts has been quoted by Meandhim.\n\nThe post that was quoted can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1893072\n\nThe post that Meandhim submitted can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1893078\n\n----------------------------------\n------------ QUOTE ----------\n@meanwhile I love the hair ideas! And I think that hair piece will look good with a ribbon. It will look so romantic. Maybe ask your friend what she thinks since she'll be able to determine if it will go with your style inspiration or not.\n\nAnd I can't believe the price went up on those dresses! Definitely worth waiting if you're not in a rush\n-----------------------------\n\n \nI will ask my friend...I guess she will have a better idea! I hoping they go down in price by the end of june at the lastest.\n \n\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nHave you thought about maybe ordering a convertible dress?  It would have straps and they can style it as they see fit for the body type? \n \nI looked into www.henkaa.com (http:\/\/www.henkaa.com) but ended up going with The Daintyard online thanks to another fab lady on this forum's recommendation.  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\nI should add that the dresses on the Daintyard were about $60 each.\n-----------------------------\n\n \nI've seen the henkaa ones but not the daintyard ones so I will look at those thanks!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of quoted posts, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1429005480,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79999,"Title":"liked a post you made in Meandhim - Grand Palladium...","Message":"Hello!\n\nMeandhim just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@meanwhile I love the hair ideas! And I think that hair piece will look good with a ribbon. It will look so romantic. Maybe ask your friend what she thinks since she'll be able to determine if it will go with your style inspiration or not.And I can't believe the price went up on those dresses!...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1893072\n","Sender":{"Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1429005324,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79988,"Title":"liked a post you made in Sparklers! (Reception,...","Message":"Hello!\n\nveryvalentine just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  I've been wanting to do this as well but not sure how feasible it is to get sparklers so thanks for starting the thread!@  thanks for the tip on asking your photographer, I'll see if he can get some for me.Do you guys think you can light them by having lit candles (bigger ones) say maybe a...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79058-sparklers-reception-first-dance\/?view=findpost&p=1893071\n","Sender":{"Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1429003498,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79975,"Title":"liked a post you made in Snswedding2016 Planning Thr...","Message":"Hello!\n\nsnswedding2016 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  thanks for the tip on the badge holders and wrist coils. I've been trying to find good sellers, particularly to Canada!And your OOT bag contents are great! I'm sure all of their sales are consistent across the country, London drugs has Emergen-c on sale for $10.99 and there's a $5 off coupon...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/?view=findpost&p=1893068\n","Sender":{"Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1429002029,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79973,"Title":"liked a post you made in Snswedding2016 Planning Thr...","Message":"Hello!\n\nMeandhim just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  thanks for the tip on the badge holders and wrist coils. I've been trying to find good sellers, particularly to Canada!And your OOT bag contents are great! I'm sure all of their sales are consistent across the country, London drugs has Emergen-c on sale for $10.99 and there's a $5 off coupon...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/?view=findpost&p=1893068\n","Sender":{"Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1429001562,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79970,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that veryvalentine mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/?view=findpost&p=1893069\n\n----------------------------------\nOuuu thanks for the coupon @\"Wafflesmom\" <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1429001363,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79968,"Title":"liked a post you made in Snswedding2016 Planning Thr...","Message":"Hello!\n\nveryvalentine just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  thanks for the tip on the badge holders and wrist coils. I've been trying to find good sellers, particularly to Canada!And your OOT bag contents are great! I'm sure all of their sales are consistent across the country, London drugs has Emergen-c on sale for $10.99 and there's a $5 off coupon...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/?view=findpost&p=1893068\n","Sender":{"Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1429001348,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79766,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that vancouverpetunia mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78730-20152016-vancouver-or-anywhere-from-bc-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1892987\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"Wafflesmom\" I live just off Main and was definitely going to try Barefoot Contessa. I didn't know about their Instagram feed though. Checked it out and there are some cute dresses there that are along the lines of what I'm looking for, so thanks! I also am going to visit Show Off! which does off the rack and custom dresses, including bridal, but they don't see to be your standard bridal designs. I hadn't even thought of the Bay! Too easy!  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>  I will start browsing there online (I didn't even think they had an online store. But I'm sure the last time I looked was a couple of years ago.)\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428958706,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79765,"Title":"liked a post you made in 2015\/2016 Vancouver (Or Any...","Message":"Hello!\n\nvancouverpetunia just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  Blue, green and purple (peacock colours) are so elegant. I love that colour scheme. And those robes totally match your vision. If you're not planning on wearing a dressy dress, then I would suggest not going to a bridal store. A lot of the dresses were quite formal so you may be limited. Hav...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78730-20152016-vancouver-or-anywhere-from-bc-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1892984\n","Sender":{"Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428958516,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79748,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that vancouverpetunia mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78730-20152016-vancouver-or-anywhere-from-bc-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1892983\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"Wafflesmom\" I saw that La Vie en Rose sale posted on the weekend and bought 3 robes online yesterday! My first wedding purchase  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> We are doing peacock colours (but not a peacock theme) - blue, green and maybe some purple. At least I think we are. I only decided that yesterday morning and then saw the robes and bought them, so I guess I've locked it in?  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428952825,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79747,"Title":"liked a post you made in 2015\/2016 Vancouver (Or Any...","Message":"Hello!\n\nvancouverpetunia just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  you're in great company, there are a lot of planners on here, myself included  You're lucky you did a site visit, we unfortunately aren't able to but we've had a lit of friends who gave been to Moon Palace and have assured us that we're in good hands. What have you decided on in terms of colou...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78730-20152016-vancouver-or-anywhere-from-bc-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1892980\n","Sender":{"Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428952720,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79708,"Title":"quoted a post you made","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that one of your posts has been quoted by vancouverpetunia.\n\nThe post that was quoted can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78730-20152016-vancouver-or-anywhere-from-bc-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1892888\n\nThe post that vancouverpetunia submitted can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78730-20152016-vancouver-or-anywhere-from-bc-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1892967\n\n----------------------------------\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nHi @\"vancouverpetunia\"! Wow, two more BC brides, I'm so happy!! How's your wedding planning?\n-----------------------------\n\n \nThings are coming along for us. We are confirmed at Now Sapphire for April 7, 2016 and just did a site visit last week (we did a last minute getaway to the Mayan Riviera, so couldn't miss the chance to pay a visit). Our guest deposits are due May 15. I think I've decided on colours and now starting to think about dresses, decor, etc. But we have a year, so I'm not too worried about it. That said, I'm a planner, so I'm now completely obsessed  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of quoted posts, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428945984,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79645,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that marinah84 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/?view=findpost&p=1892944\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\"\n \nHmmm - here's a different link, does it work?  I got it straight from the album under \"Get Link\" for this one!\n \nhttps:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.784031153664.1073741863.54300091&type=1&l=a8a5688cd7 (https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.784031153664.1073741863.54300091&type=1&l=a8a5688cd7)\n \n \n \n@\"Wafflesmom\"\n \nIt was a BLAST!  So much fun!  We both swam in college, so I think it was a little easier.  Towards the end, though, I was definitely getting tired.  I fell asleep in the car on the way back to the resort, haha.  I loved that I didn't have to worry about mascara with the eyelash extensions, too!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428928340,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79641,"Title":"liked a post you made in Marinah84's Planning Th...","Message":"Hello!\n\nmarinah84 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  your pics are gorgeous, Samuel did a beautiful job. You look like a mermaid! It looks like you made his job easy, it looked so effortless on your part!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/?view=findpost&p=1892932\n","Sender":{"Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpeg?_r=1426773379","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428928141,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79522,"Title":"liked a post you made in Kcole123 Planning Thread -...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nHave a fabulous time Kristy! Hope you have a great wedding week and we can't wait to hear all about it\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78626-kcole123-planning-thread-april-17-2015-melia-caribe-tropical\/?view=findpost&p=1892886\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428873893,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79476,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that SteeleTheSpotlight mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78846-steelethespotlights-planning-thread-may-152015-hard-rock-vallara\/?view=findpost&p=1892868\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"Wafflesmom\"\n \nWe ordered the wrist coils originally from Amazon and they were shipped from China it took almost 2 months to come and only 5 came and they were the wrong colors .. so we cancelled that and found them on a place called http:\/\/www.officeplayground.com\/Wrist-Coil-Keychain-Multicolored-P5125.aspxhttp:\/\/www.officeplayground.com\/Wrist-Coil-Keychain-Multicolored-P5125.aspx\n \nThey were $.39 per coil and the quality was great compared to the other one we recived. I also requested to have all orange shipped from the multi pack and they emailed me right back and said no problem! I recvied my order in 48 hours it was so fast! I would highly reccomend them!\n \nI will have to ask the FI about the badges we got them on ebay not sure where.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":282025,"Name":"SteeleTheSpotlight","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282025.jpg?_r=1423455490","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428865525,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79428,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that amberc mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78730-20152016-vancouver-or-anywhere-from-bc-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1892853\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"Wafflesmom\" Thanks for the Welcome!\n \nYa we have been to Puerto Vallarta twice now. The first time we stayed close to the Malecon which was really nice, and the second time we stayed at Now Amber Resort and we fell in love! It also feels less stressful planning the wedding from so far away after already visiting the resort! I definitely feel more confident about my decisions of locations for the ceremony & reception and I know what to expect in terms of food (which is excellent). \n \nI definitely want to visit the other side of Mexico as well, but Puerto Vallarta is so much more affordable living on the West Coast.... perhaps one day!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":282716,"Name":"amberc","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282716.jpg?_r=1428872610","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428850502,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79281,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that SteeleTheSpotlight mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78846-steelethespotlights-planning-thread-may-152015-hard-rock-vallara\/?view=findpost&p=1892799\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"Wafflesmom\" (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279721-wafflesmom\/) \nI know  I have not been good about doing updates haha.\nIt's hard I barley have time to work and plan haha\nThe robes fit I think true to size. I'm a 10 so I went back and forth\nwith LG and MED haha I'm right on the edge. They fit .. they are more of a fitted cut than I huge bulky robe.\n \n \n \n@TinkerSofi (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/)\n \nThanks girl! I hope so ... haha I won't feel bad when everyone throws them out hahaha\nYou can get so sucked into Esty deails lol ... then you have to come back down to earth lol\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":282025,"Name":"SteeleTheSpotlight","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282025.jpg?_r=1423455490","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428762143,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79187,"Title":"quoted a post you made","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that one of your posts has been quoted by TinkerSofi.\n\nThe post that was quoted can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1892748\n\nThe post that TinkerSofi submitted can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1892761\n\n----------------------------------\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nLove the pink shoes!! They are seriously adorable <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n-----------------------------\n\n \nThanks, my Canadian MOH hasn't seen them yet but I can quote her, she'd say \"Oh God! Those are so you!\" haha. \n \n\n------------ QUOTE ----------\n@\"TinkerSofi\" I looove those shoes, the pink ones are really nice I do agree that these will look gorgeous with your wedding gown. I love the bow and rhinestones on the ankle cuff. Elegant with bling, can't go wrong with that!\n\nI'm a big fan of brightly coloured shoes with wedding dresses. I'm also looking for a pink\/coral or blue (for something blue). Since I have time, I'm waiting for a trip across the border to try them on.\n\nAnd don't return the other sandals. Maybe shoes for your semi-private dinner?\n\nAs for your timeline, I think mingling at the bar or lounge would better so it's not as formal. I find that long tables aren't conducive to getting to know a lot of ppl, just those around you. Why don't you just have everyone meet at the lounge an hour or two before the dinner for everyone so ppl get to mingle before dinner? Then just make a separate reservation for your rehearsal dinner? Would that work?\n\nAs for your wedding day, I've been told that the optimal light for sunset pics is an hour before sunset. So if sunset is at 7:19, maybe moving the ceremony to 5-5:30 would be best since optimal time would be 6:19. Then you can take pics from 5:30-6:45 and start reception at 7. The sun sets so quickly that you may lose a lot of light by 7. This Wil ensure light and beautiful sunset pics for your couple shots\n-----------------------------\n\nI was thinking of the cocktails after the dinner but maybe before is even a better idea! And there's only 13-15 of us for the rehearsal dinner so that shouldn't be a problem to get a reservation as long as we do it as soon as we get there. I agree with you, I'm not a big fan of long tables for that same reason, you can only hear about 3-4 people but you don't tend to socialize with anyone else. We just don't get a choice for this dinner so we'll take what we get <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>. \n \nI'm used to the Canadian sunsets which are very long, I forget over there the sun sets so quickly. Good thing I mentioned it!! I was totally losing sleep over it and didn't want to finalize the welcome brochures for this reason (i'm including an itinerary)\n \nThose shoes actually come in blue, they're a very light blue. I considered them but I'm all about ballet and dancing and things like that so pink was more fitting <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>. \n \n\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nThat sounds like a good plan!! The mingling is key! Sean and I were talking to a friend last night about DWs and she said she went to one two years ago but no one introduced the group to each other or had any sort of events (private or otherwise) before the wedding so she didn't know anyone when it came time for the wedding date. I thought that was a bit bizarre. I don't think you need to do private events every night but at least get the group all together in some way so they can start to get to know one another. \n \nAs for the first look, we're still learning the process as well. At first Sean wasn't sure if he wanted to see me before the ceremony, not for superstitious reasons but he always thought the first time he'd see me in my dress would be walking down the aisle. The more we talked about it and after talking to our photographer we thought it would be best to do it to maximize our time. I also love the idea of capturing the reaction of both bride and groom seeing each other for the first time.  Our photographer says he usually only schedules them for 15 min.\n \nWe're going to do:\n \nGetting ready photos\nFirst look (15 min)\nBridal Party Pics (15-20 min)\n \nCeremony\n \nGroup Pics (family & friends 20 min)\nCouple Pics (in addition to the first look 45 min)\n \nReception\n-----------------------------\n\nThat's just horrible, if we're all in the same resort for a week it would be nice for people to be acquainted with one another. That's the beauty of a DW that you get to enjoy a whole week with all these people. I'm trying to get the social juices flowing. I know alcohol will help lol, it always does <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/>. \n \nI thought the first look was a lot longer but if it's only 15 min it's nice. Have you seen the pictures of those gorgeous walls around the resort on the brides' facebook page? I'm thinking those would be super nice spots for first look <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>, before heading down to the beach club and then taking pictures around there. I'll definitely talk to our photographer about it. We discussed it with Juan and thought it would be nice. I just want to see his face and I know that once I enter the ceremony I'll be so nervous that his face will kind of get lost in the whole moment. I think first look are a nice private moment to kind of take everything in before getting married. It might also help with my anxiety <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>. \n \n\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nThanks for the tip on the weights. I saw veil weights in Hobby Lobby last weekend in the US. I got the veil I think I'm going to wear. It's short, just past shoulders but I haven't totally decided if I'm wearing it so didn't get the weights. I have a ton of time to decide and final dress decision isn't made yet, but the veil was really cheap from preownedweddingdresses.com It's exactly what I was looking for. Yours is gorgeous!\n \nI've had music on tonight and I have the song I want to walk to to meet Doug. The problem is it makes me cry every time I listen to it! lol He thought something was wrong tonight because I was sitting here bawling my eyes out for some stupid reason! lol It has been a long 3 months and I'm exhausted from all the overtime. I get weepy when I'm over tired lol\n \nI'd be concerned about your timeline. The one thing we've always found is that sunsets down south are fast. You can literally sit there and watch the sun go down in about 15 minutes. We've done it from a cruise ship and it's amazing, but it can royally screw up pictures. That's what happened to us in Jamaica. We have exactly 3 sunset shots. We weren't ready and the sun set so quickly there wasn't a lot of time. If your sunset is at roughly 7:15, a 5pm ceremony makes more sense. You need at least 20 minutes for that, then the hugs and kisses after. You won't get away from those but you can put a time limit on it. Even at 15 minutes for hugs and kisses you're after 5:30 at least. That gives you just over an hour for pictures. That's cutting it awfully close especially if you're going to try and get family shots as well as ones of the two you alone. I would email the photographer and let them know what you're thinking and see what they say. Who are you using?\n \nThose shoes are wow!! I love them! And the heels aren't too high. I want blue shoes. I've decided that much at least lol That style is pretty and in the pink with the sparkles! Definitely!\n \nI found vows books and they aren't that expensive. Just search them on the Etsy site and there are a few really pretty ones that you can get in a groom's colour and a bride's colour. Something to think about I think. I know there are a couple of things that I want to say to Doug, but I don't know if he'll write anything. He's not really a \"flowery\" guy like that. I'll have to wait and ask him. I just know I want the marriage poem in our ceremony. We had it when we got married and I want it again since it's in essence a renewal of that poem.\n-----------------------------\n\nThanks for the tips! I forgot how fast the sun sets over there and that's kind of what was worrying me. I'd look over here and you know how it takes forever for the sun to actually disappear, but you're right, it's not like that at all over there. I'm working with Octavio Montes and he takes some amazing night time pictures too, so even if we lose the sun completely I know he'd be ready to amaze us anyway. However, I think I'll feel more comfortable moving the ceremony to 5 and then if we have a few minutes of the first look, it would be perfect. \n \nThe shoes I bought also come in light blue <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/>. They are just beautiful. I can't stop staring at them haha and since they're not too high I see myself wearing them all night (or most of the night <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/>)\n \nI think today I pretty much decided that as much as I'd love to write our own vows this will be pure torture for Juan. He's been giving me the signs that he is not totally comfortable with it but I've been too much of a bridezilla to see it. I'm not going to put him through that. Basically when I asked, he replied \"do you want to do that? ok?\" but he doesn't seem too excited about the idea haha, which means he doesn't want to do it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/>. It would be sweet for you guys to recite the same poem for your vow renewals. It's like coming full circle <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/> \n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of quoted posts, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1428708957,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79180,"Title":"liked a post you made in Tinkersofi's Planning T...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  I looove those shoes, the pink ones are really nice  I do agree that these will look gorgeous with your wedding gown. I love the bow and rhinestones on the ankle cuff. Elegant with bling, can't go wrong with that!I'm a big fan of brightly coloured shoes with wedding dresses. I'm also looking...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1892748\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1428707347,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79173,"Title":"liked a post you made in Tinkersofi's Planning T...","Message":"Hello!\n\ncalgarybride2015 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  I looove those shoes, the pink ones are really nice  I do agree that these will look gorgeous with your wedding gown. I love the bow and rhinestones on the ankle cuff. Elegant with bling, can't go wrong with that!I'm a big fan of brightly coloured shoes with wedding dresses. I'm also looking...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78768-tinkersofis-planning-thread-azul-fives-august-13-2015\/?view=findpost&p=1892748\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1428706651,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"317","TotalPages":11,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":300},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
