{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.236.1.227","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"7f6a01c6f51b83b47395700c5030e796","RawContent":"[quote name=\"racht33\" post=\"1892471\" timestamp=\"1428588602\"]\noh my mistake .. sorry. amazing video!! I should of noticed your pic and the bride in the video lol. oh man.. sorry. But you look stunning as well in your picture. Did they never send you a link to your video?? Maybe its on their vimeo along with Natasha&#039;s.[\/quote]No worries at all !! Her video is great! \nWe had our video mailed to us on a DVD . We choose to have the video for the ceremony only, but regretting not doing the full day after watching her video. From what I&#039;ve seen, it looks like they only post the full day videos. But we love our video anyways :) it&#039;s great to watch  and remember the day!","Attachments":[],"Id":1892474,"PostDate":1428575423,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>racht33, on 09 April 2015 - 10:10 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>oh my mistake .. sorry. amazing video!! I should of noticed your pic and the bride in the video lol. oh man.. sorry. But you look stunning as well in your picture. Did they never send you a link to your video?? Maybe its on their vimeo along with Natasha's.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nNo worries at all !! Her video is great! <br>\nWe had our video mailed to us on a DVD . We choose to have the video for the ceremony only, but regretting not doing the full day after watching her video. From what I've seen, it looks like they only post the full day videos. But we love our video anyways <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> it's great to watch  and remember the day! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennpurdy30@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.237.38.235","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1382445566,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274453.jpg?_r=1426602954","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jennifer146","Id":274453,"Name":"Jennifer146","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.0.198.224","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1428845971,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"66361a70bf656ff6cf7095ce9cacd792","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"kylie537\"] i hope your wedding day tomorrow is perfect!! enjoy your day!!cant wait to hear how it all went!! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892833,"PostDate":1428845953,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281397\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281397-kylie537\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kylie537<\/span><\/a> i hope your wedding day tomorrow is perfect!! enjoy your day!!cant wait to hear how it all went!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"racht33@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1422618588,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281952.jpg?_r=1424197509","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"racht33","Id":281952,"Name":"racht33","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"2.218.44.62","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0dbc035443f6dbd80cef528cae5f95a5","RawContent":"Can anyone offer advice on the dress codes for the restaurants. Are men allowed to wear dress shorts? As in can you wear a shirt &amp;amp; chino shorts or is it all long trousers?","Attachments":[],"Id":1892837,"PostDate":1428848374,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Can anyone offer advice on the dress codes for the restaurants. Are men allowed to wear dress shorts? As in can you wear a shirt & chino shorts or is it all long trousers? \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"leigh.bowman@nhs.net","IpAddress":"90.218.214.223","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407763536,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279397.jpg?_r=1408476350","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"leggi","Id":279397,"Name":"leggi","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.237.123.18","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"500b436a25da0c22d7f3b43f4ed090b3","RawContent":"[quote name=\"leggi\" post=\"1892837\" timestamp=\"1428862774\"]\nCan anyone offer advice on the dress codes for the restaurants. Are men allowed to wear dress shorts? As in can you wear a shirt &amp;amp; chino shorts or is it all long trousers?[\/quote]The buffet (carnival) is whatever you want except no cut off shirt for dinner. \nCapers dress code is no flip flops or sleeveless shirt but we went in with flip flops. Murcure is long pants and shoes for guys. Cincin is the same thing. And spice is no sleeveless shirts but you can wear shorts and flip flops as long as they are nice flip flops.\nAnd bathing suit cover up is okay at the buffet and you have to wear one walking around the resort.","Attachments":[],"Id":1892852,"PostDate":1428860915,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>leggi, on 12 April 2015 - 02:19 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>\nCan anyone offer advice on the dress codes for the restaurants. Are men allowed to wear dress shorts? As in can you wear a shirt & chino shorts or is it all long trousers?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThe buffet (carnival) is whatever you want except no cut off shirt for dinner. <br>\nCapers dress code is no flip flops or sleeveless shirt but we went in with flip flops. Murcure is long pants and shoes for guys. Cincin is the same thing. And spice is no sleeveless shirts but you can wear shorts and flip flops as long as they are nice flip flops.<br>\nAnd bathing suit cover up is okay at the buffet and you have to wear one walking around the resort. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kylie537@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.206.138.179","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1418399309,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281397.jpg?_r=1428559232","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kylie537","Id":281397,"Name":"kylie537","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.202.204.133","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2582f1aa89a182ea3acf8408145fd8ad","RawContent":"Did you guys order a meal for your photographer?\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1892902,"PostDate":1428918460,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Did you guys order a meal for your photographer?<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"howard.tracyann@gmail.com","IpAddress":"209.163.219.226","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399399856,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277868.jpg?_r=1400085061","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tracyannhoward","Id":277868,"Name":"tracyannhoward","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"12822479194807468dee55c207172b21","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:medium;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;times new roman&#039;;\"&gt;@[member=\"tracyannhoward\"] this is actually a great question. I would want to know this too... would a meal be bought for everyone : photographer, videographer, dj ? My presumption was yes as a regular wedding here in the states. Everyone has always bought them a plate.. but not sure how this works&amp;nbsp;for DW. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892906,"PostDate":1428920395,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:'times new roman';\">@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277868\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277868-tracyannhoward\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">tracyannhoward<\/span><\/a> this is actually a great question. I would want to know this too... would a meal be bought for everyone : photographer, videographer, dj ? My presumption was yes as a regular wedding here in the states. Everyone has always bought them a plate.. but not sure how this works\u00a0for DW. <\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"racht33@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1422618588,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281952.jpg?_r=1424197509","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"racht33","Id":281952,"Name":"racht33","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.222.215.164","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"68a594256db5b86df902389df974ab6a","RawContent":"Hey!! So many weddings coming up! Just thought I would share this since I cannot figured out how to load photos on here very easily! If anyone is on Instagram, there are a bunch of photos from our guests with the hashtag #diggleswedding2014 if you would like to see our ceremony and reception set up and a bunch of other crazy photos of our amazing wedding weeks!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1892924,"PostDate":1428928864,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey!! So many weddings coming up! Just thought I would share this since I cannot figured out how to load photos on here very easily! If anyone is on Instagram, there are a bunch of photos from our guests with the hashtag #diggleswedding2014 if you would like to see our ceremony and reception set up and a bunch of other crazy photos of our amazing wedding weeks!! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"candle_23@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"66.222.215.154","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1375747301,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272291.jpg?_r=1388954341","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"candle23","Id":272291,"Name":"candle23","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.15.8.25","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9acf90299345019ea915228c09214355","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Pilar at the Now JADE IMO is a joke. She is the worst! She doesn&#039;t respond in at timely manner. And when she does respond she doesn&#039;t even answer ANY of your questions. She leaves you more frustrated then before! Its almost as if she copies and pastes from past email from OTHER brides.&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"tracyannhoward\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Ask for the guitarist direct email address. He will send you songs that he is familiar with and that is in his repertoire.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;He sent me an entire listing!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892959,"PostDate":1428949450,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Pilar at the Now JADE IMO is a joke. She is the worst! She doesn't respond in at timely manner. And when she does respond she doesn't even answer ANY of your questions. She leaves you more frustrated then before! Its almost as if she copies and pastes from past email from OTHER brides.<\/p>\n<br \/><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277868\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277868-tracyannhoward\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">tracyannhoward<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ask for the guitarist direct email address. He will send you songs that he is familiar with and that is in his repertoire.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>He sent me an entire listing!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>65 Guests + Bride and Groom!","Email":"yasminea84@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.15.8.25","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410267445,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279750.jpg?_r=1411781584","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"yasminea84","Id":279750,"Name":"yasminea84","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":5178,"TotalPages":518,"CurrentPage":5170,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":5160,"LastPage":5170},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
