> User racht33 (281952)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7b430b7e944817767b30c94e6cc64094","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"kylie537\"] im glad things haven gotten better for you at the resort. Your post had me a bit scared to even consider Now Jade.&amp;nbsp; Has the food been better than what you stated before? How have the drinks been ... watered down or decent? Have heard mixed feedback on this. You must be super excited the day is getting closer!!!! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892307,"PostDate":1428491763,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281397\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281397-kylie537\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kylie537<\/span><\/a> im glad things haven gotten better for you at the resort. Your post had me a bit scared to even consider Now Jade.\u00a0 Has the food been better than what you stated before? How have the drinks been ... watered down or decent? Have heard mixed feedback on this. You must be super excited the day is getting closer!!!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"racht33@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1422618588,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281952.jpg?_r=1424197509","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"racht33","Id":281952,"Name":"racht33","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.237.123.18","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eb04505ea2aeae4da4199b3cb15f4bb7","RawContent":"[quote name=\"racht33\" post=\"1892307\" timestamp=\"1428506163\"]\n@[member=\"kylie537\"] im glad things haven gotten better for you at the resort. Your post had me a bit scared to even consider Now Jade.  Has the food been better than what you stated before? How have the drinks been ... watered down or decent? Have heard mixed feedback on this. You must be super excited the day is getting closer!!!! :)[\/quote]\nWell the Buffet food is...buffet\nFood but we went to a few of the restaurants this week and the Asian restaurant spice is actually decent, the hibachi is pretty fun and the Italian restaurant is REALLY good. It&#039;s called capers. Mercure isn&#039;t the greatest. And we haven&#039;t been to the mexican or cin cin yet or had lunch at castaways yet. \nI really enjoy eating at restaurants outdoors especially when you are in such a beautiful climate and the restaurants outdoor eating is very limited. So I avoided eating there because I didn&#039;t want to sit in a dark\nAuper air conditioned room\nFor a few hours. \nWe are in the preferred side (DEFINITELY WORTH the upgrade) we got moved to the top floor with 3 balconies and it&#039;s about 1000+sq ft. It was a wedding gift from our parents. This made a huge difference as well having a beautiful ocean view overlooking the adult only pool. \nNo the drinks aren&#039;t watered down but the premium alchohol is really only on the preferred side in the preferred lounge. The drinks definitely aren&#039;t very strong and the pool side service is a little lacking but if you don&#039;t have kids then take advantage of the adults only pool. We dream of using that pool lol.. \nand I know that people have mentioned it before on here but it&#039;s really important. around the pools is very very slippery. We have seen SO many people slip and fall, probably every 10 minutes, and a lot of people have gotten badly injured. Hopefully they do something about it one day here. \nAnd the beach has cleared up a bit ;)\nAlso I will add that my parents came a few days ago and absolutely love this resort. I would suggest only having the buffet for breakfast and lunch only and avoid going for dinner if possible. I was comparing it to a\nDifferent resort but now spending a week here there is no comparison, aside from the beach. Now jade is a really beautiful resort.","Attachments":[],"Id":1892383,"PostDate":1428510123,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>racht33, on 08 April 2015 - 11:16 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281397\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281397-kylie537\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kylie537<\/span><\/a> im glad things haven gotten better for you at the resort. Your post had me a bit scared to even consider Now Jade.\u00a0 Has the food been better than what you stated before? How have the drinks been ... watered down or decent? Have heard mixed feedback on this. You must be super excited the day is getting closer!!!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br><br>\nWell the Buffet food is...buffet<br>\nFood but we went to a few of the restaurants this week and the Asian restaurant spice is actually decent, the hibachi is pretty fun and the Italian restaurant is REALLY good. It's called capers. Mercure isn't the greatest. And we haven't been to the mexican or cin cin yet or had lunch at castaways yet. <br>\nI really enjoy eating at restaurants outdoors especially when you are in such a beautiful climate and the restaurants outdoor eating is very limited. So I avoided eating there because I didn't want to sit in a dark<br>\nAuper air conditioned room<br>\nFor a few hours. <br>\nWe are in the preferred side (DEFINITELY WORTH the upgrade) we got moved to the top floor with 3 balconies and it's about 1000+sq ft. It was a wedding gift from our parents. This made a huge difference as well having a beautiful ocean view overlooking the adult only pool. <br>\nNo the drinks aren't watered down but the premium alchohol is really only on the preferred side in the preferred lounge. The drinks definitely aren't very strong and the pool side service is a little lacking but if you don't have kids then take advantage of the adults only pool. We dream of using that pool lol.. <br>\nand I know that people have mentioned it before on here but it's really important. around the pools is very very slippery. We have seen SO many people slip and fall, probably every 10 minutes, and a lot of people have gotten badly injured. Hopefully they do something about it one day here. <br>\nAnd the beach has cleared up a bit <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><br \/>Also I will add that my parents came a few days ago and absolutely love this resort. I would suggest only having the buffet for breakfast and lunch only and avoid going for dinner if possible. I was comparing it to a<br>\nDifferent resort but now spending a week here there is no comparison, aside from the beach. Now jade is a really beautiful resort. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kylie537@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.206.138.179","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1418399309,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281397.jpg?_r=1428559232","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kylie537","Id":281397,"Name":"kylie537","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.56.23.126","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"32bb81e80460610c1e30f8267d55efda","RawContent":"@[member=\"kylie537\"] great feedback thank you!!! Were they able to show you alternate ceremony locations if it were to rain on the wedding day ? .. ive sent a note to get pictures and have even attempted to Google if possible and have yet to see images or videos etc Where there was an alternate rain location. your room sounds amazing! ! Counting down the days until Sept when I can go see everything for myself :)( going 2 a friends wedding in mexico)","Attachments":[],"Id":1892407,"PostDate":1428519307,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281397\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281397-kylie537\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kylie537<\/span><\/a> great feedback thank you!!! Were they able to show you alternate ceremony locations if it were to rain on the wedding day ? .. ive sent a note to get pictures and have even attempted to Google if possible and have yet to see images or videos etc Where there was an alternate rain location. your room sounds amazing! ! Counting down the days until Sept when I can go see everything for myself <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>( going 2 a friends wedding in mexico) \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"racht33@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1422618588,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281952.jpg?_r=1424197509","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"racht33","Id":281952,"Name":"racht33","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.237.123.18","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"39508e95604f12344265b85c83df21e4","RawContent":"[quote name=\"racht33\" post=\"1892407\" timestamp=\"1428533707\"]\n@[member=\"kylie537\"] great feedback thank you!!! Were they able to show you alternate ceremony locations if it were to rain on the wedding day ? .. ive sent a note to get pictures and have even attempted to Google if possible and have yet to see images or videos etc Where there was an alternate rain location. your room sounds amazing! ! Counting down the days until Sept when I can go see everything for myself :)( going 2 a friends wedding in mexico)[\/quote]\nMy wedding coordinator showed me the alternative location for the ceremony in case it rains. If you want to message me your email I can send you a photo. I don&#039;t know how to attach photos onto this group forum thing.","Attachments":[],"Id":1892453,"PostDate":1428544625,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>racht33, on 08 April 2015 - 06:55 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281397\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281397-kylie537\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kylie537<\/span><\/a> great feedback thank you!!! Were they able to show you alternate ceremony locations if it were to rain on the wedding day ? .. ive sent a note to get pictures and have even attempted to Google if possible and have yet to see images or videos etc Where there was an alternate rain location. your room sounds amazing! ! Counting down the days until Sept when I can go see everything for myself <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>( going 2 a friends wedding in mexico)<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nMy wedding coordinator showed me the alternative location for the ceremony in case it rains. If you want to message me your email I can send you a photo. I don't know how to attach photos onto this group forum thing. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kylie537@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.206.138.179","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1418399309,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281397.jpg?_r=1428559232","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kylie537","Id":281397,"Name":"kylie537","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.28.143","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"60ef3c3eb6153ffb2c57c4d314ffb8b3","RawContent":"[quote name=\"kylie537\" post=\"1892453\" timestamp=\"1428559025\"]\nMy wedding coordinator showed me the alternative location for the ceremony in case it rains. If you want to message me your email I can send you a photo. I don&#039;t know how to attach photos onto this group forum thing.[\/quote]Would you be able to send them to me as well? I&#039;m getting married in October so chances of rain are fairly high. Thanks!!! \n\nBri.barber88@[member=\"gmail\"].com","Attachments":[],"Id":1892458,"PostDate":1428566243,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>kylie537, on 09 April 2015 - 01:57 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>My wedding coordinator showed me the alternative location for the ceremony in case it rains. If you want to message me your email I can send you a photo. I don't know how to attach photos onto this group forum thing.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nWould you be able to send them to me as well? I'm getting married in October so chances of rain are fairly high. Thanks!!! <br><br>\nBri.barber88@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"briannehillier@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.183.193.17","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1422361322,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281895.jpg?_r=1422484746","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"breezie","Id":281895,"Name":"breezie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bf7f9b521ab651db9d61c355e88835a3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Jennifer146\"] your video is amazing!!!!! You look stunning!! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892464,"PostDate":1428571915,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"274453\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/274453-jennifer146\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Jennifer146<\/span><\/a> your video is amazing!!!!! You look stunning!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"racht33@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1422618588,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281952.jpg?_r=1424197509","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"racht33","Id":281952,"Name":"racht33","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.236.1.227","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4600099a08a8c6c1c098d2fcac305382","RawContent":"[quote name=\"racht33\" post=\"1892464\" timestamp=\"1428586315\"]\n@[member=\"Jennifer146\"] your video is amazing!!!!! You look stunning!! :)[\/quote][quote name=\"racht33\" post=\"1892464\" timestamp=\"1428586315\"]\n@[member=\"Jennifer146\"] your video is amazing!!!!! You look stunning!! :)[\/quote]Thank you so much ! We had such an amazing time :) \nMay I ask where you saw the video? I&#039;ve been trying to find it online with no luck . \nAlso, I haven&#039;t forgotten about posting some pics to help with some other questions .. I just have to upload them to my laptop :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1892467,"PostDate":1428573489,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>racht33, on 09 April 2015 - 09:31 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"274453\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/274453-jennifer146\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Jennifer146<\/span><\/a> your video is amazing!!!!! You look stunning!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>racht33, on 09 April 2015 - 09:31 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"274453\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/274453-jennifer146\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Jennifer146<\/span><\/a> your video is amazing!!!!! You look stunning!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThank you so much ! We had such an amazing time <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br>\nMay I ask where you saw the video? I've been trying to find it online with no luck . <br>\nAlso, I haven't forgotten about posting some pics to help with some other questions .. I just have to upload them to my laptop <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennpurdy30@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.237.38.235","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1382445566,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274453.jpg?_r=1426602954","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jennifer146","Id":274453,"Name":"Jennifer146","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1428574017,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3eed9a0bc56e9003108d6b5c982861b9","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Natata\" post=\"1888976\" timestamp=\"1426085846\"]\nfor all you upcoming brides - i definately recommend getting the videographer for the whole day - just received my sneak peak of my video and i can&#039;t wait to see the whole thing - here&#039;s a lil viewing they sent me - wish i was able to do it all over agian\n[font=&#039;Times New Roman&#039;][size=5][url=\"https:\/\/vimeo.com\/121823055\"]https:\/\/vimeo.com\/121823055[\/url][\/size][\/font][\/quote]i saw this video that you posted on the forum. :)@[member=\"Jennifer146\"] or maybe this isnt your video and i got the quotes confused,,,&amp;gt;??!","Attachments":[],"Id":1892468,"PostDate":1428573944,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Natata, on 11 March 2015 - 10:57 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>for all you upcoming brides - i definately recommend getting the videographer for the whole day - just received my sneak peak of my video and i can't wait to see the whole thing - here's a lil viewing they sent me - wish i was able to do it all over agian<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:18pt;\"><a href='https:\/\/vimeo.com\/121823055' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/vimeo.com\/121823055<\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>i saw this video that you posted on the forum. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"274453\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/274453-jennifer146\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Jennifer146<\/span><\/a> or maybe this isnt your video and i got the quotes confused,,,>??!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"racht33@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1422618588,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281952.jpg?_r=1424197509","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"racht33","Id":281952,"Name":"racht33","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.236.1.227","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"107b3b26be3adcb2e7c7408f656c9616","RawContent":"[quote name=\"racht33\" post=\"1892468\" timestamp=\"1428588344\"]\ni saw this video that you posted on the forum. :)@[member=\"Jennifer146\"] or maybe this isnt your video and i got the quotes confused,,,&amp;gt;??![\/quote]\nOh this is another bride Natasha :) and yes she was stunning. I quoted it saying I wish we had done the whole day instead of just the ceremony . :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1892470,"PostDate":1428574118,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>racht33, on 09 April 2015 - 10:05 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>i saw this video that you posted on the forum. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"274453\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/274453-jennifer146\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Jennifer146<\/span><\/a> or maybe this isnt your video and i got the quotes confused,,,>??!<\/p><\/div><\/div><br>\nOh this is another bride Natasha <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> and yes she was stunning. I quoted it saying I wish we had done the whole day instead of just the ceremony . <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennpurdy30@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.237.38.235","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1382445566,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274453.jpg?_r=1426602954","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jennifer146","Id":274453,"Name":"Jennifer146","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fdb5773b32339c503318bc6a847db44c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Jennifer146\" post=\"1892470\" timestamp=\"1428588518\"]\nOh this is another bride Natasha :) and yes she was stunning. I quoted it saying I wish we had done the whole day instead of just the ceremony . :)[\/quote]oh my mistake .. sorry. amazing video!! I should of noticed your pic and the bride in the video lol. oh man.. sorry. But you look stunning as well in your picture. Did they never send you a link to your video?? Maybe its on their vimeo along with Natasha&#039;s.","Attachments":[],"Id":1892471,"PostDate":1428574202,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Jennifer146, on 09 April 2015 - 10:08 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Oh this is another bride Natasha <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> and yes she was stunning. I quoted it saying I wish we had done the whole day instead of just the ceremony . <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>oh my mistake .. sorry. amazing video!! I should of noticed your pic and the bride in the video lol. oh man.. sorry. But you look stunning as well in your picture. Did they never send you a link to your video?? Maybe its on their vimeo along with Natasha's.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"racht33@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1422618588,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281952.jpg?_r=1424197509","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"racht33","Id":281952,"Name":"racht33","IsOnline":true}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":5178,"TotalPages":518,"CurrentPage":5160,"NextPage":5170,"Previ