{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":80198,"Title":"liked a post you made in New Bdw Mobile App For Both...","Message":"Hello!\n\nSteveW just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nyay!!! I didnt like the tap talk app. So this is perfect!!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79055-new-bdw-mobile-app-for-both-ios-and-android\/?view=findpost&p=1892894\n","Sender":{"Id":206829,"Name":"SteveW","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206829.jpg?_r=1386354305","PhotoWidth":344,"PhotoHeight":339,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429056290,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79591,"Title":"liked a post you made in New Bdw Mobile App For Both...","Message":"Hello!\n\nAlexBrecher just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nyay!!! I didnt like the tap talk app. So this is perfect!!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79055-new-bdw-mobile-app-for-both-ios-and-android\/?view=findpost&p=1892894\n","Sender":{"Id":282720,"Name":"AlexBrecher","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282720.jpg?_r=1429130049","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428927126,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":78348,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"racht33,\n\nStack02 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Alternative Location Ceremony\".\n\nStack02 said:\n======================================================================\nGood lord my spelling above! Sorry about that!\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9301&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":274310,"Name":"Stack02","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274310.jpg?_r=1414099482","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428528872,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9301},{"Id":78347,"Title":"started a new personal conversation with you","Message":"racht33,\n\nStack02 has sent you a new personal conversation entitled \"Alternative Location Ceremony\".\n\nStack02 said:\n======================================================================\nHello,\n\n\nWe got married at the NJ in October and 5 minutes before the skys opened up and it poured. We were put in the front hallway at the entrance. Because of the rain we ran out of light for photos. Froend me on FB I literally posted all the ceremony pucs yesterday Stacey Keller I live in Calgary Canada and my profile picture is entering the Bamboo room.\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=showConversation&topicID=9301#msg17042\n","Sender":{"Id":274310,"Name":"Stack02","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274310.jpg?_r=1414099482","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428528364,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9301},{"Id":78272,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that MissJen3 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79030-wedding-gift-for-groom-ideas-share-your-ideas\/?view=findpost&p=1892387\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"racht33\" Thank you. I dont expect him to read the whole thing, on that day. I suspect it will be read over time. I am just super cheesy and thought that it would be something we could both look back on. \n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":278914,"Name":"MissJen3","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278914.jpg?_r=1427504777","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428510254,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":78249,"Title":"liked a post you made in Wedding Gift For Groom Idea...","Message":"Hello!\n\nveryvalentine just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  what a thoughtful idea! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> He will love it!! May be hard for him to read 365 reasons with so many nerves but i bet it will calm them down reading how much you love him!! Great idea!\n \nI buy my fiance a watch every year for his birthday, Its just something that has carried t...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79030-wedding-gift-for-groom-ideas-share-your-ideas\/?view=findpost&p=1892358\n","Sender":{"Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1428501609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428505164,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":77912,"Title":"liked a post you made in Dress Advice","Message":"Hello!\n\nGingerBride just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  I think this dress looks great on you! I love it! The sweetheart and the belt are just perfect!! Honestly there is nothing traditional about a DW anyway.. thats the fun thing about it NO RULES!! so you can wear whatever you want its your wedding day!! But in all this is a great pick!! I hop...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79028-dress-advice\/?view=findpost&p=1892124\n","Sender":{"Id":279720,"Name":"GingerBride","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279720.jpg?_r=1412546963","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428430778,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":75361,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"racht33,\n\necl has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"email\".\n\necl said:\n======================================================================\nI just forwarded you a bunch of emails from Melina. \n \nOur planning is going well, pretty much all done.  When we went in Nov, we met with Melina and basically discussed and decided on the flowers (I took pictures), the decor, the menu, the dancefloor, lights\/decor, etc.  We will still see her 2 days before the wedding to officially run over everything and finalize it all. \n \nThe only thing I still have to do before I leave is send an offcial guest list (which will include the entree selections they made for the reception)  and provide them with our song lists  (i.e. ideas of songs we want to hear, special songs like first dance and the do not play list) and Melina will forward to the DJ ahead of time.  For the ceremony, we were told to bring a playlist of the songs we want and they have an ipod attachement.\n \nother than that, I have kept the items I am bringing for the wedding to a minimum (I've seen other BDW brides bring tonnes of stuff, I am not a DIYer, nor do I want to spend a tonne on extra baggage fees)  What I am bringing are: table numbers; menus; seating chart, name tents, battery powered tea lights & we ordered custom tumblers for the welcome gift & I'm printing off welcome letters\/itineraries to slip inside them.\n \nOh one thing to mention -  Melina and Deyanira sometimes seem really slow to respond to emails.  My advice is to be patient and try to remember they have weddings every single day of the year down there.  They have always responded to me, sometimes it just took a week or 2.  Also, when we were there, I noticed they really focus on the bride & grooms that are getting married during that week, which is what I would expect of them.\n \n \n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9138&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":278078,"Name":"ecl","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278078.jpg?_r=1427847663","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427372580,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9138},{"Id":75276,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"racht33,\n\necl has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"email\".\n\necl said:\n======================================================================\nHey Racht33, I sent you an email directly.  Wanted to let you know in case it went to your junk.  my email address is eclarose@shaw.ca\n \n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9138&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":278078,"Name":"ecl","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278078.jpg?_r=1427847663","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427319961,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9138},{"Id":74955,"Title":"liked a post you made in Any Recent Feedback About H...","Message":"Hello!\n\necl just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  congratulations! So exciting the time is getting closer for you!! Im excited to hear someone actually knowing some details on the location. I love the Jetty and that's what is drawing me to the place. The price seems so amazing for everything they offer. Are you aware of any planning thread...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78972-any-recent-feedback-about-hotel-marina-el-cid\/?view=findpost&p=1890581\n","Sender":{"Id":278078,"Name":"ecl","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278078.jpg?_r=1427847663","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427213875,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":74863,"Title":"liked a post you made in Entertaining Guest Outside...","Message":"Hello!\n\nSmellsey just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"vancouverpetunia\" data-cid=\"1890080\" data-time=\"1426795121\">@  & @racht33 - I think we did the exact same tour in 2010 (Coba, Mayan village & cenote), but unfortunately I don't know the name of the company either <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/>\n ...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78942-entertaining-guest-outside-of-resort\/?view=findpost&p=1890173\n","Sender":{"Id":279143,"Name":"Smellsey","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279143.jpg?_r=1411496026","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427195152,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73656,"Title":"started a new personal conversation with you","Message":"racht33,\n\nSmellsey has sent you a new personal conversation entitled \"Pricing\".\n\nSmellsey said:\n======================================================================\nWhat is your email? I am not sure how to attach things on here lol\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=showConversation&topicID=9070#msg16644\n","Sender":{"Id":279143,"Name":"Smellsey","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279143.jpg?_r=1411496026","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426770317,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9070},{"Id":73644,"Title":"liked a post you made in Entertaining Guest Outside...","Message":"Hello!\n\n2015Bride just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nWould anyone have suggestions on group excursions in the Riviera Maya area? Catamaran cruises, party boats, snorkeling, ATVs, Jet Skis  etc. I want to find something to do outside of the resort and looking for suggestions from past Mexico visitors. Also I would like suggestions if this is...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78942-entertaining-guest-outside-of-resort\/?view=findpost&p=1889858\n","Sender":{"Id":277737,"Name":"2015Bride","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426767528,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73582,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that BecomingaRiggio mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78938-std-and-invite-suggestions\/?view=findpost&p=1889993\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"racht33\" if you like my boarding passes, they are available on zazzle.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":278682,"Name":"BecomingaRiggio","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278682.jpg?_r=1414954781","PhotoWidth":187,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426759951,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73511,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that JoannaBanana mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78938-std-and-invite-suggestions\/?view=findpost&p=1889960\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"racht33\" The only reason it worked for my friend is because she had a small group.  I don't think it would work for me either. \n \nI love the boarding passes, but I think they might be too much effort and money for STD.  I think I'll do postcard STD, and invite Boarding Pass only to those who seem interested.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":282128,"Name":"JoannaBanana","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282128.jpg?_r=1426731614","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":114,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1426754034,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73367,"Title":"liked a post you made in Is It Inappropriate To Ask...","Message":"Hello!\n\nVictoriabride just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  I feel like we are possibly on the same dilemma and I just let it go\n \nMy FI's parents are well off and comfortable and they continuously are reachimg out to us to help with anything. They have offered everything from extra money for the room stay, to buying decor to even p...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78943-is-it-inappropriate-to-ask-parents-for-help-with-wedding-expenses\/?view=findpost&p=1889862\n","Sender":{"Id":282027,"Name":"Victoriabride","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426711393,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73218,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that BecomingaRiggio mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78932-cancun-riviera-maya-selecting-venue-help-please\/?view=findpost&p=1889832\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"racht33\", the package through my TA includes transport to\/from airport and resort. I honestly didnt research how far the drive is or how much it would be to leave. None of my guests expressed interest in leaving the resort.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":278682,"Name":"BecomingaRiggio","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278682.jpg?_r=1414954781","PhotoWidth":187,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426679215,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73180,"Title":"liked a post you made in Azul Sensatori Brides - POS...","Message":"Hello!\n\natyson03 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nIve been working with my TA for over a month now and Hes currently looking into Azul Sensatori contract to get my date locked in. Fingers crossed this works out!! Im super excited to get this process started for 2016 and share it with you guys!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/18414-azul-sensatori-brides-post-here\/?view=findpost&p=1889810\n","Sender":{"Id":277535,"Name":"atyson03","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277535.jpg?_r=1397079819","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426671655,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73136,"Title":"liked a post you made in Centerpieces\/ Decorations\/...","Message":"Hello!\n\nTinkerSofi just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  thank you! I will contact them and see if they have any further info they can share. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78902-centerpieces-decorations-flowers-help\/?view=findpost&p=1889685\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426636272,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73085,"Title":"khmciver has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"racht33,\n\nkhmciver has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Using Love and Lace\".\n\nkhmciver said:\n======================================================================\nHi! I just responded in the forum. If you have any questions, please feel free to email me - khmciver@gmail.com. I would DEFINITELY use her. So helpful. \n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9022&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":275598,"Name":"kellymenning","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275598.jpg?_r=1426649427","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426612821,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9022},{"Id":73084,"Title":"khmciver mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that khmciver mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78902-centerpieces-decorations-flowers-help\/?view=findpost&p=1889760\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"racht33\"\nI used Love & Lace and she was AWESOME. It all started because I really wanted those lights that are the bulbs on the string. There has to be a better way for me to explain that. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Anyway, the hotel was going to charge me $200 for a strand of lights. They told me I needed at least 10 strands. That's when I read about Katy on this site somewhere. She charged like $15 per strand. Clearly so much cheaper. I literally rented almost everything she has. You name it, I rented it..lights, chargers, vases, burlap runners, lace runners, chair sashes, candles, paper bags to line the pool...the list goes on and one. I rented everything and it was awesome. It looked absolutely stunning. She's great to work with too. She's very responsive and so organized. She arranged a time for me to meet her in town and get everything from her. Then I didn't have to pay an outside vendor fee. She even got sparklers for me which was great! I really wanted sparklers and the hotel was going to charge me $8\/sparkler!!! She even bought matches for me. Of course, I paid her...but she's the best. I HIGHLY recommend using her. She saved me on cost a lot. A LOT. I was already bringing so many suitcases with everything welcome bag oriented so I didn't have room for decorations. I even rented sheers and a \"light wall\" from her. It was beautiful.  You can always email me at khmciver@\"gmail\".com and I'm happy to answer more questions. I'll find some pics to post. \n@\"racht33\" Here are some pictures. @\"lornj29\" I would check Container Store for a tray or target. I saw white lacquer trays at both of those recently. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>    \n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":275598,"Name":"kellymenning","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275598.jpg?_r=1426649427","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426612780,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73080,"Title":"khmciver mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that khmciver mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78902-centerpieces-decorations-flowers-help\/?view=findpost&p=1889760\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"racht33\"\nI used Love & Lace and she was AWESOME. It all started because I really wanted those lights that are the bulbs on the string. There has to be a better way for me to explain that. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Anyway, the hotel was going to charge me $200 for a strand of lights. They told me I needed at least 10 strands. That's when I read about Katy on this site somewhere. She charged like $15 per strand. Clearly so much cheaper. I literally rented almost everything she has. You name it, I rented it..lights, chargers, vases, burlap runners, lace runners, chair sashes, candles, paper bags to line the pool...the list goes on and one. I rented everything and it was awesome. It looked absolutely stunning. She's great to work with too. She's very responsive and so organized. She arranged a time for me to meet her in town and get everything from her. Then I didn't have to pay an outside vendor fee. She even got sparklers for me which was great! I really wanted sparklers and the hotel was going to charge me $8\/sparkler!!! She even bought matches for me. Of course, I paid her...but she's the best. I HIGHLY recommend using her. She saved me on cost a lot. A LOT. I was already bringing so many suitcases with everything welcome bag oriented so I didn't have room for decorations. I even rented sheers and a \"light wall\" from her. It was beautiful.  You can always email me at khmciver@\"gmail\".com and I'm happy to answer more questions. I'll find some pics to post. \n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":275598,"Name":"kellymenning","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275598.jpg?_r=1426649427","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426612077,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73074,"Title":"liked a post you made in Oot Welcome Bags - Mexican-...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@smileitsebIve heard of a few ladies going shopping and buying Mexican candies. Can never go wrong with edibles <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>.  I myself have been looking into some items with a theme and came across these.. thought they were so cute. <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.wholesalecentral.com\/...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78930-oot-welcome-bags-mexican-themed-items\/?view=findpost&p=1889684\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1426610240,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":73053,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"racht33,\n\nreynbow has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Using Love and Lace\".\n\nreynbow said:\n======================================================================\nHi there.  Happy to share info with you <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>  I'm very happy I went with Love & Lace for the big\/bulky\/heavy\/breakable decoration items so I wouldn't have to lug all this stuff on the plane.  Renting items through Katy HK (Love & Lace) was so much more affordable than renting it through our wedding venue.  I rented her globe bulb stringed lights, charger plates (these were quite heavy), glass bottles that I used on our reception tables and had flower stems put in them and a few wicker baskets.  I also rented paper lanterns and some LED pillars that were small items but I figured since I'd probably never need them again, it was better to just rent them so I didn't have to put this stuff in my luggage either.  You can see some of my decorations here:\n         So I definitely recommend Love & Lace if cost and luggage space are an issue for you.  Katy HK is very friendly, helpful and responsive.  Her husband works for a yacht cruise company if you're interested in an excursion for your guests.  We did the yacht, got a great deal through Katy, and everyone loved it. \n \n \n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9021&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":276575,"Name":"reynbow","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276575.jpg?_r=1424562947","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426608843,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9021},{"Id":73021,"Title":"liked a post you made in Looking For Reviews","Message":"Hello!\n\nJanelleAdams just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  Welcome to BDW and congrats!!! Have you checked for the resort in Resort Reviews ? Tripadvisor is also a great sort for the resort reviews and also looking for Destination Wedding Review Forums for the resorts.\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78926-looking-for-reviews\/?view=findpost&p=1889662\n","Sender":{"Id":282429,"Name":"JanelleAdams","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282429.jpg?_r=1426470959","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":268,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426604451,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":72977,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that smileitseb mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78930-oot-welcome-bags-mexican-themed-items\/?view=findpost&p=1889695\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"racht33\" well i was about to order from that site but its a minimum $100 order so I'm going to search around. I'll let you know!!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":277044,"Name":"smileitseb","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277044.jpg?_r=1428066900","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":224,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426595923,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":72971,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that smileitseb mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78930-oot-welcome-bags-mexican-themed-items\/?view=findpost&p=1889691\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"racht33\" I love these ponchos!!!! Ordering now <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":277044,"Name":"smileitseb","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277044.jpg?_r=1428066900","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":224,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426595120,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":72969,"Title":"liked a post you made in Oot Welcome Bags - Mexican-...","Message":"Hello!\n\nsmileitseb just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@smileitsebIve heard of a few ladies going shopping and buying Mexican candies. Can never go wrong with edibles <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>.  I myself have been looking into some items with a theme and came across these.. thought they were so cute. <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.wholesalecentral.com\/...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78930-oot-welcome-bags-mexican-themed-items\/?view=findpost&p=1889684\n","Sender":{"Id":277044,"Name":"smileitseb","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277044.jpg?_r=1428066900","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":224,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426594009,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":71785,"Title":"liked a post you made in Do I Have To Have A Wedding...","Message":"Hello!\n\nSteeleTheSpotlight just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@andreaberrettaI love your program!!!  Did you create your own template for this?\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78867-do-i-have-to-have-a-wedding-program\/?view=findpost&p=1888272\n","Sender":{"Id":282025,"Name":"SteeleTheSpotlight","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282025.jpg?_r=1423455490","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1426027987,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":70918,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that smileitseb mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78875-polaroid-guest-book\/?view=findpost&p=1888498\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"racht33\" They told me I could rent 3, no option to only rent 1.\n \n@\"pddcmc\" I went to Joann's Fabrics and had success!! I bought the scrapbook and the camera for $70, now just have to get a silver pen, sign with instructions and film!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":277044,"Name":"smileitseb","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277044.jpg?_r=1428066900","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":224,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1425569308,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"62","TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":60},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
